    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>The macro for the game «Locked» in Roblox performs a sequence of actions: it throws the ball into the air, then makes a sharp turn right, dribbling the ball with you. Misses are possible, especially when the ping is high. It is recommended to use 800 DPI and sensitivity.171 in Roblox. The resolution of 1920 x 1080 is convenient, but you can use any one, since the mouse movement is based on relative coordinates.</Description>
